    "notes": "39 community annotations from pinned, MIT-licensed source files. Coordinates are source-image pixels divided by 8192, with a top-left origin, x increasing east/right and y south/down. The nominal 8000 m side length is not the pixel divisor. No in-game verification was performed for LootLizard; completeness, current access and entrance precision are unverified. 34 ziphow security-room points are supplemented by five distinct adzpm points corroborated by recent public key-use detections. Drone-only rooms were not deliberately imported. Ripton has closely spaced/multilevel rooms: this two-dimensional map does not identify the floor, door or key availability, and the list may still be incomplete. Exact source ids/pixels are retained in data-sources/secret-locations.json. No source artwork is copied by this import. Licenses: THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Reviewed 2026-10-22."
